   "source": [
    "# Observed vs. predicted fit figures\n",
    "\n",
    "Builds the two supplement figures from the BEST Tobit fits:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Full grid**: 18 panels, every antibody-antigen complex, titled with the selected\n",
    "   interaction order and the regularization behind that fit.\n",
    "2. **Selected sites**: observed vs. predicted for one complex, split by germline or\n",
    "   mutant at a chosen site. Works for any antibody, antigen, and site.\n",
    "\n",
    "Observed values are replicate averages per genotype from `{antibody}_kds.csv`.\n",
    "Predictions are `predicted_kd_full` from `{antibody}_{antigen}_BEST_df_all.csv`.\n",
    "Both are censored at the 6.0 detection floor."
   ],
   "id": "ggLczbCTAXH1"
  },
